Error [jet.ReturnTypeMismatch]: This value is String (text), but this lambda returns Int
  --> generic_lambda_conflict.jet:4:32
    |
  4 |     print(apply(fn(n: Int) { n.to_string() }, 1))
    |                                ^^^^^^^^^
 Why: This lambda's result is Int, so the value it hands back must be Int
 Fix: Hand back a Int value: convert this value to Int, or return the value you meant
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E0113
